Bound GS worker frames in flight on the GPU (default 2, GOW_GS_FRAME_LATENCY=0 = reference).
The worker context never swaps, so only the 4x8 MiB vertex ring throttled it: GPU-bound scenes queued tens of frames, then stalled at a wrap.
Fences guard no resource; each wait is bounded to 50 ms and never falls back to glFinish.
Validation: tools/test/gs-frame-latency.cpp; docs/research/frame-latency-2026-11-11.md.

